    "markdown": "# B&W\n\n# BROWN & WILLIAMSON TOLIACCO CORPORATION\n\nApril 3, 1974\n\nMr. Charles Wiley\n\nc/o Allen-Martin Productions\n\n9701 Taylorsville Road\n\nLouisville, Kentucky 40299\n\nDear Mr. Wiley:\n\nThis is to confirm my request that you arrange to print for VICEROY, your full ASI ads for Time-size kcylinas. We will need your quote by 4/10.\n\n# I. Ad Description\n\nA. Names and Numbers:\n\n1. \"Flying Car - Mortise\" V-MC-74-11\n\n2 \"Blurred Car - Mortise\" - V-MG-74-12\n\n3 \"Gold Trophy - Mortise\" - V-MG-74-13\n\n4. \"32 Drivers - Mortise\" - V-MG-74-14\n\nB. Please include the following information on these ads:\n\n1. Ad Nane\n\n2. Ad Number\n\n3. Magazine\n\nII. Quantity requirements and specifications:\n\n800 copies cach cn 50# Patina\n\n7\" x 10\" printed on stock\n\n12-1/2\" x 16\" (Min.) and\n\n\\(23^{\\prime \\prime}\\times 20^{\\prime \\prime}\\) (Max.)\n\nIII. Timetable\n\nFirst Proof - 4/12\n\nComplete 4/17\n\nAds to L.A. - 4/19\n\nG80079667"
